 北蠕虫（Avannaascolex apalos）\cite{1}\n@b站 梅\n\n属名来自格陵兰语“北方”+古希腊语“蠕虫”，指其发现地的纬度极高；种加词来自古希腊语“光滑的”，指其缺乏体板的形态。北蠕虫生存于寒武纪第二世第三期的格陵兰，化石出土于下布恩组（Lower Buen Formation），正模标本NHMD002051391是一个基本完整的标本，此外它还有几个归入标本。\n  北蠕虫属于古蠕虫形类（Palaeoscolecidomorpha），它是一种极其细长的蠕虫形动物，吻部近端生有刺，并可见粗糙的咽齿，远端吻部则整体光滑，躯体缺乏体板骨片，复测神经索不对称。系统发育分析显示它可能与马库尔蠕虫（Markuelia）存在亲缘关系，不过由于古蠕虫形类的系统发育位置和单系性均存在争议，其准确的演化位置需要未来更多的研究去确定。\n  北蠕虫是一种罕见地缺失了体板骨片的古蠕虫形类物种，虽然无法完全排除是埋藏学因素造成的，但考虑到西利乌斯帕塞特特异埋藏（Sirius Passet Lagerstätte）中其它蜕皮动物（Ecdysozoa）的保存状态，科学家认为更可能是北蠕虫本身就不存在体板结构。\n  最后，北蠕虫保存了不成对的腹侧神经索，这进一步表明了不成对的腹侧神经索是蜕皮动物的祖征，成对的腹侧神经索则是后期独立演化出来的产物。这对理解蜕皮动物的演化提供了新思路。\n  \n图一：北蠕虫正模的原始保存状态\n\n图二：北蠕虫正模的内脏、领部和吻部\n\n图三：北蠕虫副模标本的咽部和咽腔\n\n图四：论文的系统发育分析\n\n\references=[\n    "Farrell, T.P., Lee, M., Nielsen, M.L., Parry, L.A., Nielsen, A.T., Park, T.-Y.S. Edgecombe, G.D., and Vinther, J. 2026. An unusual new palaeoscolecidomorph worm from the Cambrian Stage 3 Sirius Passet Lagerstätte in North Greenland. Acta Palaeontologica Polonica 71 (3): 619–636. https://doi.org/10.4202/app.01387.2026"\n    "Darwin C. 1859"\n]\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('471401bd-c69d-4bbb-8486-738ad5664814',1,'test_code_function',replace('<h1 id="fastapi">fastapi</h1>\n<p>基于python</p>\n<p>原生支持<span style="color:red">异步</span></p>\n<h1 id="交互式文档">交互式文档</h1>\n<h1 id="pydantic">Pydantic</h1>\n<p>pycharm -&gt;fastapi</p>\n<p>python环境\nvirtual env</p>\n<h2 id="mainpy">main.py</h2>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>var python_code=&quot;&quot;&quot;\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)\nasync def root():\n  return {&quot;message&quot;:&quot;hello World&quot;}\n\n&quot;&quot;&quot;</code></pre></div></div></div>\n<p>启动项目：\nuvicorn main:app --reload</p>','\n',char(10)),'创建文章','2026-09-28T14:27:12.257Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# fastapi\n\n基于python \n\n原生支持\fontcolor{red}{异步}\n\n# 交互式文档\n# Pydantic\n\npycharm ->fastapi\n\npython环境\nvirtual env\n\n## main.py\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\nvar python_code="""\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get("/")\nasync def root():\n  return {"message":"hello World"}\n\n"""\n---\n\n```\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n启动项目：\nuvicorn main:app --reload\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('87479351-ebd0-4625-82bb-24df3f30f1a7',1,'test3',replace('<h1 id="fastapi">fastapi</h1>\n<p>基于python</p>\n<p>原生支持<span style="color:red">异步</span></p>\n<h1 id="交互式文档">交互式文档</h1>\n<p>/docs</p>\n<h1 id="pydantic">Pydantic</h1>\n<p>pycharm -&gt;fastapi</p>\n<p>python环境\nvirtual env</p>\n<h2 id="mainpy">main.py</h2>\n<p>文件入口</p>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>[python]\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)\nasync def root():\n  return {&quot;message&quot;:&quot;hello World&quot;}\n\n&quot;&quot;&quot;</code></pre></div></div></div>\n<h4 id="启动项目的命令">启动项目的命令：</h4>\n<p>uvicorn main:app --reload</p>\n<p>修改代码会自动重启服务（热更新）</p>\n<h1 id="访问端口">访问端口</h1>\n<h1 id="路由url地址与-处理函数-的映射">路由：url地址与 处理函数 的映射</h1>\n<p>py装饰器\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)</p>\n<p>get 请求方法\n请求path</p>\n<p>返回结构/</p>','\n',char(10)),'创建文章','2026-09-28T14:46:32.615Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# fastapi\n\n基于python \n\n原生支持\fontcolor{red}{异步}\n\n# 交互式文档\n/docs\n\n# Pydantic\n\npycharm ->fastapi\n\npython环境\nvirtual env\n\n## main.py\n文件入口\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\n[python]\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get("/")\nasync def root():\n  return {"message":"hello World"}\n\n"""\n---\n\n```\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n#### 启动项目的命令：\nuvicorn main:app --reload\n\n修改代码会自动重启服务（热更新）\n\n# 访问端口\n\n# 路由：url地址与 处理函数 的映射\n\npy装饰器\n@app.get("/")\n\nget 请求方法\n请求path\n\n返回结构/\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('87479351-ebd0-4625-82bb-24df3f30f1a7',2,'fastapi',replace('<h1 id="fastapi">fastapi</h1>\n<p>基于python</p>\n<p>原生支持<span style="color:red">异步</span></p>\n<h1 id="交互式文档">交互式文档</h1>\n<p>/docs</p>\n<h1 id="pydantic">Pydantic</h1>\n<p>pycharm -&gt;fastapi</p>\n<p>python环境\nvirtual env</p>\n<h2 id="mainpy">main.py</h2>\n<p>文件入口</p>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>[python]\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)\nasync def root():\n  return {&quot;message&quot;:&quot;hello World&quot;}</code></pre></div></div></div>\n<pre><code class="language-pytho">from fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)\nasync def root():\n  return {&quot;message&quot;:&quot;hello World&quot;}</code></pre>\n<h4 id="启动项目的命令">启动项目的命令：</h4>\n<p>uvicorn main:app --reload</p>\n<p>修改代码会自动重启服务（热更新）</p>\n<h1 id="访问端口">访问端口</h1>\n<h1 id="路由url地址与-处理函数-的映射">路由：url地址与 处理函数 的映射</h1>\n<p>py装饰器\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)</p>\n<p>get 请求方法\n请求path</p>\n<p>返回结构/</p>','\n',char(10)),'更新文章','2026-09-28T14:50:31.715Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# fastapi\n\n基于python \n\n原生支持\fontcolor{red}{异步}\n\n# 交互式文档\n/docs\n\n# Pydantic\n\npycharm ->fastapi\n\npython环境\nvirtual env\n\n## main.py\n文件入口\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\n[python]\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get("/")\nasync def root():\n  return {"message":"hello World"}\n---\n\n```\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```pytho\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get("/")\nasync def root():\n  return {"message":"hello World"}\n```\n\n#### 启动项目的命令：\nuvicorn main:app --reload\n\n修改代码会自动重启服务（热更新）\n\n# 访问端口\n\n# 路由：url地址与 处理函数 的映射\n\npy装饰器\n@app.get("/")\n\nget 请求方法\n请求path\n\n返回结构/\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('87479351-ebd0-4625-82bb-24df3f30f1a7',3,'fastapi',replace('<h1 id="fastapi">fastapi</h1>\n<p>基于python</p>\n<p>原生支持<span style="color:red">异步</span></p>\n<h1 id="交互式文档">交互式文档</h1>\n<p>/docs</p>\n<h1 id="pydantic">Pydantic</h1>\n<p>pycharm -&gt;fastapi</p>\n<p>python环境\nvirtual env</p>\n<h2 id="mainpy">main.py</h2>\n<p>文件入口</p>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>[python]\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)\nasync def root():\n  return {&quot;message&quot;:&quot;hello World&quot;}</code></pre></div></div></div>\n<pre><code class="language-pytho">from fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)\nasync def root():\n  return {&quot;message&quot;:&quot;hello World&quot;}</code></pre>\n<h4 id="启动项目的命令">启动项目的命令：</h4>\n<p>uvicorn main:app --reload</p>\n<p>修改代码会自动重启服务（热更新）</p>\n<h1 id="访问端口">访问端口</h1>\n<h1 id="路由url地址与-处理函数-的映射">路由：url地址与 处理函数 的映射</h1>\n<p>py装饰器\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)</p>\n<p>get 请求方法\n请求path</p>\n<p>返回结构/</p>','\n',char(10)),'更新文章','2026-09-28T14:51:02.201Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# fastapi\n\n基于python \n\n原生支持\fontcolor{red}{异步}\n\n# 交互式文档\n/docs\n\n# Pydantic\n\npycharm ->fastapi\n\npython环境\nvirtual env\n\n## main.py\n文件入口\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\n[python]\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get("/")\nasync def root():\n  return {"message":"hello World"}\n---\n\n```\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```pytho\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp =FastAPI()\n\n@app.get("/")\nasync def root():\n  return {"message":"hello World"}\n```\n\n#### 启动项目的命令：\nuvicorn main:app --reload\n\n修改代码会自动重启服务（热更新）\n\n# 访问端口\n\n# 路由：url地址与 处理函数 的映射\n\npy装饰器\n@app.get("/")\n\nget 请求方法\n请求path\n\n返回结构/\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('519452fe-d0ed-43c9-a377-34aaa1d6644c',1,'字符串',replace('<h1 id="字符串">字符串</h1>\n<h2 id="2026-10-08">2026-10-08</h2>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>[cpp]\n#include&lt;iostream&gt; \n\nusing namespace std;\n\nvoid getNext(string&amp; s,int&amp; []next){\n	\n	next[i]=1;\n	int j=0;\n	int i=1;\n	\n	while(i&lt;s.size()) {\n		\n		if(s[j]==s[i]||j==0) {\n			i++;\n			j++;\n			next[i]= j;\n		}\n		else{\n			j=next[i];\n		}\n	}\n}\n\nvoid print_arr(int&amp; arr[],int len){\n	for(int i=1;i&lt;=len;i++){\n		cout&lt;&lt;arr[i]&lt;&lt;&quot; &quot;;\n	}\n	\n}\n\nint main(){\n	int t;\n	cin&gt;&gt;t;\n	\n	while(t--){\n		// 主串 \n		string p;\n		// 模式串 \n		string a;\n	    cin&gt;&gt;p&gt;&gt;a;\n		// 1-base\n		a=&quot; &quot;+a;\n		p=&quot; &quot;+p;\n		\n		// next 数组 \n		int next[a.size()+1]; \n		getNext(a,next);\n		\n		print_arr(next,a.size());\n		cout&lt;&lt;kmp(p,a)&lt;&lt;endl;\n	}\n\n}</code></pre></div></div></div>\n<p>kmp算法</p>','\n',char(10)),'创建文章','2026-10-08T12:05:23.860Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# 字符串\n\n## 2026-10-08\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\n[cpp]\n#include<iostream> \n\nusing namespace std;\n\nvoid getNext(string& s,int& []next){\n	\n	next[i]=1;\n	int j=0;\n	int i=1;\n	\n	while(i<s.size()) {\n		\n		if(s[j]==s[i]||j==0) {\n			i++;\n			j++;\n			next[i]= j;\n		}\n		else{\n			j=next[i];\n		}\n	}\n}\n\nvoid print_arr(int& arr[],int len){\n	for(int i=1;i<=len;i++){\n		cout<<arr[i]<<" ";\n	}\n	\n}\n\nint main(){\n	int t;\n	cin>>t;\n	\n	while(t--){\n		// 主串 \n		string p;\n		// 模式串 \n		string a;\n	    cin>>p>>a;\n		// 1-base\n		a=" "+a;\n		p=" "+p;\n		\n		// next 数组 \n		int next[a.size()+1]; \n		getNext(a,next);\n		\n		print_arr(next,a.size());\n		cout<<kmp(p,a)<<endl;\n	}\n\n}\n---\n\n```\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\nkmp算法\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('519452fe-d0ed-43c9-a377-34aaa1d6644c',2,'字符串',replace('<h1 id="字符串">字符串</h1>\012<h2 id="2026-10-08">2026-10-08</h2>\012<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>[cpp]\012#include&lt;iostream&gt; \012#include&lt;vector&gt; \012#include&lt;string&gt;\012\012using namespace std;\012\012void getNext(string&amp; s, vector&lt;int&gt;&amp; next) {\012	// i 要先声明 \012	int j = 0;\012	int i = 1;\012	next[1] = 0;\012\012	int len = s.size() - 1;\012	while (i &lt; len) {\012\012		if (s[j] == s[i] || j == 0) {\012			i++;\012			j++;\012			next[i] = j;\012		}\012		else {\012			j = next[j];\012		}\012	}\012}\012\012int kmp(string&amp; p, string&amp; a) {\012	if (a.size() &gt; p.size())return -1;\012	\012	int i = 1;\012	int j = 1;\012\012	// 下标范围[0,size)\012	// 但 1-base\012	// 但 这里是STL实现的\012\012	while (i &lt; p.size() &amp;&amp; j &lt; a.size()) {\012		if (j == 0 || p[i] == a[j]) {\012			++i;\012			++j;\012		}\012	}\012\012}\012\012void print_arr(vector&lt;int&gt;&amp; arr) {\012	for (int i = 1; i &lt; arr.size(); i++) {\012		cout &lt;&lt; arr[i] - 1 &lt;&lt; &quot; &quot;;\012	}\012	cout &lt;&lt; &quot;\n&quot;;\012}\012\012int main() {\012	int t;\012	cin &gt;&gt; t;\012\012	while (t--) {\012		// 主串 \012		string p;\012		// 模式串 \012		string a;\012		cin &gt;&gt; p &gt;&gt; a;\012		// 1-base\012		a = &quot; &quot; + a;\012		p = &quot; &quot; + p;\012\012		// next 数组 \012		vector&lt;int&gt; next(a.size(), 0);\012\012		getNext(a, next);\012\012		print_arr(next);\012		cout&lt;&lt;kmp(p)&lt;&lt;endl;\012	}\012\012}</code></pre></div></div></div>\012<p>kmp算法</p>','\012',char(10)),'更新文章','2026-10-08T12:26:36.607Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\012\012\cellbreak=[\012]\012\012# 字符串\012\012## 2026-10-08\012\012\cellbreak=[\012]\012\012```sample\012[cpp]\012#include<iostream> \012#include<vector> \012#include<string>\012\012using namespace std;\012\012void getNext(string& s, vector<int>& next) {\012	// i 要先声明 \012	int j = 0;\012	int i = 1;\012	next[1] = 0;\012\012	int len = s.size() - 1;\012	while (i < len) {\012\012		if (s[j] == s[i] || j == 0) {\012			i++;\012			j++;\012			next[i] = j;\012		}\012		else {\012			j = next[j];\012		}\012	}\012}\012\012int kmp(string& p, string& a) {\012	if (a.size() > p.size())return -1;\012	\012	int i = 1;\012	int j = 1;\012\012	// 下标范围[0,size)\012	// 但 1-base\012	// 但 这里是STL实现的\012\012	while (i < p.size() && j < a.size()) {\012		if (j == 0 || p[i] == a[j]) {\012			++i;\012			++j;\012		}\012	}\012\012}\012\012void print_arr(vector<int>& arr) {\012	for (int i = 1; i < arr.size(); i++) {\012		cout << arr[i] - 1 << " ";\012	}\012	cout << "\n";\012}\012\012int main() {\012	int t;\012	cin >> t;\012\012	while (t--) {\012		// 主串 \012		string p;\012		// 模式串 \012		string a;\012		cin >> p >> a;\012		// 1-base\012		a = " " + a;\012		p = " " + p;\012\012		// next 数组 \012		vector<int> next(a.size(), 0);\012\012		getNext(a, next);\012\012		print_arr(next);\012		cout<<kmp(p)<<endl;\012	}\012\012}\012---\012\012```\012\012\cellbreak=[\012]\012\012kmp算法\012','\012',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('f1de1639-f123-45c8-95b6-2828400eff4a',1,'线性代数+python+人工智能',replace('<h1 id="向量">向量</h1>\n<h2 id="起始点不重要">起始点不重要</h2>\n<h2 id="相对原点">相对原点</h2>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>class Vector:\n  def __init__(self,lst):\n    self._vlues = lst;\n  def __repr__(self):\n    return &quot;Vector({})&quot;.format(self._values)\n  def __str__(self):\n    return &quot;({})&quot;.format(&quot; &quot;.join(e for e in self._values))\n\n\n    ## 魔法方法\n    ## repr :系统输出\n    ## str 用户输出 print(vector)\n    ## 类似 运算符 重载 字符串输出\n\n    # 构造函数</code></pre></div></div></div>','\n',char(10)),'创建文章','2026-10-09T08:07:05.465Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# 向量\n\n## 起始点不重要\n## 相对原点\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\nclass Vector:\n  def __init__(self,lst):\n    self._vlues = lst;\n  def __repr__(self):\n    return "Vector({})".format(self._values)\n  def __str__(self):\n    return "({})".format(" ".join(e for e in self._values))\n\n\n    ## 魔法方法\n    ## repr :系统输出\n    ## str 用户输出 print(vector)\n    ## 类似 运算符 重载 字符串输出\n\n    # 构造函数\n---\n\n```\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
INSERT INTO "post_revisions" ("post_id","revision_number","title","content_html","change_note","created_at","created_by","classification_card_json","citations_json","document_format","ui_pdf_source","content_laup","content_kernel") VALUES('544db539-f855-4189-b150-c2d28343b405',1,'??',replace('<h1 id="向量">向量</h1>\n<h2 id="起始点不重要">起始点不重要</h2>\n<h2 id="相对原点">相对原点</h2>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#0</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code>class Vector:\n  def __init__(self,lst):\n    self._vlues = list(lst);\n  def __repr__(self):\n    return &quot;Vector({})&quot;.format(self._values)\n  def __str__(self):\n    return &quot;({})&quot;.format(&quot; &quot;.join(e for e in self._values))\n\n    ## 魔法方法\n    ## repr :系统输出\n    ## str 用户输出 print(vector)\n    ## 类似 运算符 重载 字符串输出\n\n    # 构造函数\n\n\n    \n  # 长度、维度  \n  def __len__(self):\n    return len(self._values)\n\n  # []运算符重载\n  def __getitem__(self,index):\n    return self._values[index]\n\n  # 加法重载\n  # 返回的新的Vec,而不是在原地修改\n  def __add__(self,another):\n    assert len(self)==len(another),\\n        &quot;Error in adding&quot;\n    return Vecor([a+b for a,b in zip(self,another)])\n\n  # 迭代器\n  # c++也有\n  def __iter__(self):\n    return self._values.__iter__()\n\n\n  def __sub__(self,another):\n    assert len(self)==len(another),\\n        &quot;Error in adding&quot;\n    return Vecor([a-b for a,b in zip(self,another)])</code></pre></div></div></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Python 的魔法方法（如 __init__、__str__、__len__ 等）是以双下划线包围、在特定场景下由解释器自动触发的特殊方法，用于自定义对象的内置行为，例如初始化、打印、运算符重载、索引访问与上下文管理等。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Python 中使用 assert 的步骤</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>确保 Python 环境已正确安装并运行。</p>\n<p>在代码中插入 assert 语句，用于检查某个条件是否为真。</p>\n<p>使用以下基本语法： 简单形式：assert 表达式 如果表达式为 True，程序继续执行。 如果表达式为 False，抛出 AssertionError 异常。</p>\n<p>扩展形式：assert 表达式, 错误消息 当表达式为 False 时，抛出 AssertionError 并显示自定义错误消息。</p>\n<p>运行代码并观察是否有断言错误。</p>\n<p>在调试或测试阶段使用 assert，避免在生产环境中滥用以免影响性能.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>python 其实没有私有成员这一概念</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>我们可以自己规定</p>\n<h1 id="在这里我们其实是">在这里我们其实是</h1>\n<p><span style="color:red">重载了</span>python 提供的接口</p>\n<p>实现统一维度的运算规则</p>\n<div class="life-code-sample" data-life-code-sample="1"><div class="life-code-sample-head"><span class="life-code-sample-bar"></span><span class="life-code-sample-title">样例</span><span class="life-code-sample-title-en">Sample</span></div><div class="life-code-sample-grid is-single"><div class="life-code-sample-pane is-input"><div class="life-code-sample-pane-head"><span class="life-code-sample-label">输入<em>#1</em></span><span class="life-code-sample-sub">Input</span></div><pre class="life-code-sample-body"><code># 导入包\nimport \n\n\nif __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:</code></pre></div></div></div>\n<h1 id="向量的运算">向量的运算</h1>\n<h2 id="向量的加法">向量的加法</h2>\n<h3 id="原理">原理：</h3>\n<p>由 几何意义-&gt;xy轴移动方向-&gt;\n由此推出 平行四边形 法则+ 对应坐标相加</p>\n<h2 id="向量数乘">向量数乘</h2>\n<h3 id="原理-2">原理：</h3>\n<p>由 加法推广</p>\n<h2 id="向量的减法">向量的减法</h2>\n<p>本质是 向量的加法</p>','\n',char(10)),'创建文章','2026-10-09T08:33:50.472Z','69ce3b6d-41f1-42f7-b766-cf9784bdeb0d','{"cards":[]}','[]','html','',replace('import "laup"\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# 向量\n\n## 起始点不重要\n## 相对原点\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\nclass Vector:\n  def __init__(self,lst):\n    self._vlues = list(lst);\n  def __repr__(self):\n    return "Vector({})".format(self._values)\n  def __str__(self):\n    return "({})".format(" ".join(e for e in self._values))\n\n    ## 魔法方法\n    ## repr :系统输出\n    ## str 用户输出 print(vector)\n    ## 类似 运算符 重载 字符串输出\n\n    # 构造函数\n\n\n    \n  # 长度、维度  \n  def __len__(self):\n    return len(self._values)\n\n  # []运算符重载\n  def __getitem__(self,index):\n    return self._values[index]\n\n  # 加法重载\n  # 返回的新的Vec,而不是在原地修改\n  def __add__(self,another):\n    assert len(self)==len(another),\\n        "Error in adding"\n    return Vecor([a+b for a,b in zip(self,another)])\n\n  # 迭代器\n  # c++也有\n  def __iter__(self):\n    return self._values.__iter__()\n\n\n  def __sub__(self,another):\n    assert len(self)==len(another),\\n        "Error in adding"\n    return Vecor([a-b for a,b in zip(self,another)])\n---\n\n```\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n> Python 的魔法方法（如 __init__、__str__、__len__ 等）是以双下划线包围、在特定场景下由解释器自动触发的特殊方法，用于自定义对象的内置行为，例如初始化、打印、运算符重载、索引访问与上下文管理等。\n\n> Python 中使用 assert 的步骤\n\n确保 Python 环境已正确安装并运行。\n\n在代码中插入 assert 语句，用于检查某个条件是否为真。\n\n使用以下基本语法： 简单形式：assert 表达式 如果表达式为 True，程序继续执行。 如果表达式为 False，抛出 AssertionError 异常。 \n\n扩展形式：assert 表达式, 错误消息 当表达式为 False 时，抛出 AssertionError 并显示自定义错误消息。\n\n运行代码并观察是否有断言错误。\n\n在调试或测试阶段使用 assert，避免在生产环境中滥用以免影响性能.\n\n> python 其实没有私有成员这一概念\n\n我们可以自己规定\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# 在这里我们其实是\n\textcolor{red}{重载了}python 提供的接口\n\n实现统一维度的运算规则\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n```sample\n# 导入包\nimport \n\n\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n---\n\n```\n\n\cellbreak=[\n]\n\n# 向量的运算\n## 向量的加法\n### 原理：\n由 几何意义->xy轴移动方向->\n由此推出 平行四边形 法则+ 对应坐标相加\n\n## 向量数乘\n### 原理：\n由 加法推广\n\n## 向量的减法\n本质是 向量的加法\n','\n',char(10)),NULL);
