生命物质开始向有序生命物质的转变。从而产生了第一个能够维持自身代谢的生命系统。","expand":true,"hyperlink":"","hyperlinkTitle":"","image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"uid":"37f92cdd-5cbc-48f6-822f-7969413eed3e","text":"FUCA","expand":true,"hyperlink":"","hyperlinkTitle":"","image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"96036003-746a-48b2-80b8-0784c6206508","text":"FUCA标志着生命不仅仅有代谢，而且开始有合成蛋白质的能力，标志着遗传编码的初步成型。RNA开始催化氨基酸连接成短肽，并形成翻译系统的雏形","expand":true,"hyperlink":"","hyperlinkTitle":"","image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"uid":"1857b44a-231d-4b40-8cfa-2722b1f6c1fb","text":"病毒世界","expand":true,"hyperlink":"","hyperlinkTitle":"","image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"b35c2be3-4629-4a5b-b4d8-5765d5b15592","text":"既是细胞基因的祖先，也是现代病毒的起源。","expand":true,"hyperlink":"","hyperlinkTitle":"","image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"uid":"eaa455c8-db72-4d2d-8e94-bd639723b0fb","text":"LUCA","expand":true,"hyperlink":"","hyperlinkTitle":"","image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"bord