%E6%BA%90\n\n2弗朗切斯科·雷迪\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%97%E6%9C%97%E5%88%87%E6%96%AF%E7%A7%91%C2%B7%E9%9B%B7%E8%BF%AA\n3\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Needham\n\n4\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lazzaro_Spallanzani\n\n5\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_Pasteur\n\n6胚种论\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%83%9A%E7%A8%AE%E8%AB%96\n\n7\n哲人石丛书珍藏版生机勃勃的尘埃地球生命的起源和进化  克里斯蒂安\n\n8\nGómez-Márquez, J. The Origin of Life and Cellular Systems: A Continuum from Prebiotic Chemistry to Biodiversity. Life 2025, 15, 1745. https://doi.org/10.3390/life15111745\n\n\n9海底热液系统\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E7%86%B1%E6%B3%89\n\n\n\n\n10\nSojo V, Herschy B, Whicher A, Camprubí E, Lane N. The Origin of Life in Alkaline Hydrothermal Vents. Astrobiology. 2016 Feb;16(2):181-97. doi: 10.1089/ast.2015.1406. Epub 2016 Feb 3. PMID: 26841066.\n\n11Metabolism-First Hypothesis\nhttps://www.labxchange.org/library/items/lb:HarvardX:12228b34:html:1\n\n\n12\nKoonin EV, Martin W. On the origin of genomes and cells within inorganic compartments. Trends Genet. 2005 Dec;21(12):647-54. doi: 10.1016/j.tig.2005.09.006. Epub 2005 Oct 11. PMID: 16223546; PMCID: PMC7172762.\n\n13范·列文虎克\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E6%9D%B1%E5%B0%BC%C2%B7%E8%8C%83%C2%B7%E5%88%97%E6%96%87%E8%99%8E%E5%85%8B\n\n14原始汤\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%B9%AF\n\n\n15RNA World Hypothesis\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RNA_world\n\n\n16\nProsdocimi, F., José, M.V., de Farias, S.T. (2019). The First Universal Common Ancestor (FUCA) as the Earliest Ancestor of LUCA’s (Last UCA) Lineage. In: Pontarotti, P. (eds) Evolution, Origin of Life, Concepts and Methods. Springer, Cham. https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-030-30363-1_3\n\n17\nA. Akbari, & B.O. Palsson, Metabolic homeostasis and growth in abiotic cells, Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U.S.A. 120 (19) e2300687120, https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2300687120 (2023).\n\n\n\n18\nMartin, W., Baross, J., Kelley, D. et al. Hydrothermal vents and the origin of life. Nat Rev Microbiol 6, 805–814 (2008). https://doi.org/10.1038/nrmicro1991\n\n19\n生命的起源 生命的共同祖先40亿年前怎样诞生 刘大可\n\n20\nWeiss, M., Sousa, F., Mrnjavac, N. et al. The physiology and habitat of the last universal common ancestor. Nat Microbiol 1, 16116 (2016). https://doi.org/10.1038/nmicrobiol.2016.116\n\n21\nSojo V, Pomiankowski A, Lane N (2014) A Bioenergetic Basis for Membrane Divergence in Archaea and Bacteria. PLOS Biology 12(8): e1001926. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.1001926\n\n\n\n\n22卡尔·乌斯\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E4%B9%8C%E6%96%AF\n\n23人类起源论\nhttps://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%BA%E9%A1%9E%E8%B5%B7%E6%BA%90%E8%AB%96\n\n24\nMoody, E.R.R., Álvarez-Carretero, S., Mahendrarajah, T.A. et al. The nature of the last universal common ancestor and its impact on the early Earth system. Nat Ecol Evol 8, 1654–1666 (2024). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41559-024-02461-1\n\n\n\n25\nKoonin, E.V., Senkevich, T.G. & Dolja, V.V. The ancient Virus World and evolution of cells. Biol Direct 1, 29 (2006). https://doi.org/10.1186/1745-6150-1-29','\n',char(10)),'');
