angle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"4d66b833-87e1-44aa-a0d7-4e91b4a720b9","text":"†金伯拉虫 Kimberella","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"8fac35a9-b173-4b1c-8612-2b7815561761","text":"环节动物门（Annelida）、多毛纲（Polychaeta）：","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"9b965ee2-c4c7-4d28-8fbd-f528f68d867d","text":"阿氏.古扇虫（Ipoliknus avitus），标本残段长1厘米，底栖游走、肉食性，属于环节动物门、多毛纲基底物种。生活在早寒武纪第二世，5.2亿年前的中国云南省、玉溪市、澄江县、帽天山生物群。显著的特征包括完整的分节躯干和疣足、以及从疣足伸出的成束刚毛。最奇特的是，古扇虫的躯干表面还具有分节排列的小刺以及小刺之下的两行骨片结构。","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"90f0bbf7-f220-48bc-9b6a-fb23d68e38dd","text":"乌龙箐新.圆货贝(Neobolus wulongqingensis)及其壳外的寄生性管居动物，该寄生物属于环节动物门、多毛纲、缨鳃虫目？产自早寒武纪第二世，5.15亿年前的中国云南省、昆明市、关山生物群、乌龙箐组的浅海环境。","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"0ef3ad06-8ae8-4034-9a4a-c4cad14c7153","text":"塔氏.丹尼多毛虫（Dannychaeta tucolus），体长10厘米，底栖穴居、肉食性，属于环节动物门、多毛纲、长手沙虫科。生活在早寒武纪第二世，5.14亿年前的中国云南省东部、曲靖市、马龙县、沧浪铺组。牠具有一个铁楸状头部和一对细长的触须，这是现生环节动物支系的最早化石记录，表明丹尼多毛虫和现生环节动物由同一个最近共同祖先演化而来。","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"de65c41e-9438-4fff-b804-6044ea354ced","text":"犬齿.芦苇虫（Phragmochaeta canicularis），无头躯干长2.2厘米，深海游走式底栖，以浮游生物、有机颗粒为食，属于环节动物门、多毛纲。生活在寒武纪第二世，5.2亿—5.16亿年前的格陵兰、天狼星帕西特动物群。","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"d138c5d5-414a-438d-9e42-22f6af34e087","text":"多刺.加拿大虫（Canadia  spinosa），体长4.5厘米，底栖游走、肉食性。属于环节动物、多毛纲。生存在晚寒武纪苗岭世，5.05亿年前的加拿大、不列颠哥伦比亚省、伯吉斯生物群。","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"cfabd755-1903-4a23-b351-32d8e9ff387e","text":"巴氏.库特尼虫（Kootenayscolex barbarensis），体长2.5厘米，底栖游走、肉食性。属于环节动物、多毛纲。生存在晚寒武纪苗岭世，5.05亿年前的加拿大、不列颠哥伦比亚省、伯吉斯生物群。躯干分为25个体节，每个体节具有56根纤毛。像其他纤毛虫一样，牠的头上也有刺毛，从身体两侧伸出来，也有部分纤毛围绕着嘴部生长，似乎表明，环节动物的头部是从后部体节进化而来。","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"2b629474-930d-4672-9673-f99990ec7c0f","text":"阿姆斯特朗.韦伯斯特虫(Websteroprion armstrongi)，颚齿长1厘米，体长1-2米，浅海底栖穴居、肉食性，属于环节动物、多毛纲、游走亚纲、矶沙蚕目、矶沙蚕科？生活在中泥盆世，3.933亿年前的加拿大、安大略省、哈德逊湾盆地、兔子山脊、夸德罗斯组（Kwataboahegan Formation）的浅海环境。","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"uid":"8eca234c-f7dc-4fdb-91db-2071f0976af9","text":"螺旋卵裂动物","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"59e4d7ac-c3c8-442f-a5f0-44dca64e7b97","text":"有颚动物 Gnathifera","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"0ff9de89-bd84-4aaa-a863-6e1ed7ae415d","text":"颚胃动物门 Gnathostomulida","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"957a0262-fdd2-4e28-ba3d-c6af9a9a5644","text":"微颚动物门 Micrognathozoa","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"f3eb00ca-bc9a-4b93-9c93-90a36a252823","text":"轮形动物门 Rotifera/轮毛动物门 Syndermata","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"0958c207-d84f-42cb-8df0-219637c84bff","text":"棘头动物门 Acanthocephala","expand