rderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"1af68f7b-fac5-41c6-9959-61433b1a4bcc","text":"†骨鳞鱼科 Osteolepidae","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"da20b846-1761-4719-9344-993223a2c668","text":"†属 Medoevia","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[]},{"data":{"uid":"b8ac088e-a5eb-4110-ad8f-da522253f871","text":"†巨鱼科 Megalichthyidae","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children":[{"data":{"uid":"5eef155b-e6dd-4665-ad6a-cd43d3cd4d87","text":"巨鱼科（Megalichthyidae）于中晚泥盆世出现，是在泥盆纪末大灭绝后幸存下来的四足形类肉鳍鱼之一，并一直延续到二叠纪早期。它们生活在淡水沼泽和湖泊环境中，有些种类可以长到非常大。这个家族的典型特征是骨头上覆盖着齿鳞质和位于前上颌骨的长牙，而且几乎都来自北半球。只有该科的散鳞鱼（Cladarosymblema narrienense ）是个例外。      此前，在接近鱼-四足动物过渡的这个重要进化时期，人们对大脑形态特别是颅内模的变化知之甚少，而这对发展关于四足形类干群内神经演化的假说又很有价值。真掌鳍鱼等一些肉鳍鱼类的脑颅构造已经通过传统的连续磨片方法为人知晓。近些年CT又帮助我们重建了奇异东生鱼和戈戈鼻鱼（Gogonasus andrewsae）的部分虚拟脑颅内模。而散鳞鱼则是四足形类肉鳍鱼中第一个被完整地重建和可视化其颅内模的。在对两个澳大利亚昆士兰州下石炭统雷蒙德组（Raymond Formation）的3D保存的散鳞鱼标本；QMF 21082和QMF 21083使用高分辨率显微 CT 和同步加速器断层扫描后，古生物学家揭示了解剖结构中前所未见的细节。他们发现，与仍然","expand":true,"contentLinks":[],"citationNumbers":[],"image":"","imageTitle":"","color":"#000000","fillColor":"#ffffff","borderColor":"#ffffff","lineColor":"#000000","borderWidth":0,"borderDasharray":"","fontSize":15,"fontWeight":"normal","shape":"rectangle"},"children"